{"file": "一身腱子肉，乱世做谋臣-第119集.mp4", "ep": 119, "duration": 61.4, "segments": [{"start": 1.34, "end": 3.23, "text": "韩成"}, {"start": 3.23, "end": 4.23, "text": "你的对手是我"}, {"start": 4.23, "end": 5.23, "text": "赵广小儿"}, {"start": 5.23, "end": 6.23, "text": "那日暗箭之仇"}, {"start": 6.23, "end": 7.23, "text": "今日断兵相见"}, {"start": 7.23, "end": 9.23, "text": "老子定将你碎尸万段"}, {"start": 35.34, "end": 36.34, "text": "你翻来覆去"}, {"start": 36.34, "end": 37.34, "text": "何止就会这三板斧啊"}, {"start": 37.34, "end": 38.34, "text": "放屁"}, {"start": 38.34, "end": 40.34, "text": "三招也足够剁了你下酒"}, {"start": 40.34, "end": 42.34, "text": "吃老子一斧"}, {"start": 43.34, "end": 45.68, "text": "三招已过"}, {"start": 45.68, "end": 46.68, "text": "受死吧"}, {"start": 46.68, "end": 47.68, "text": "妈呀"}, {"start": 47.68, "end": 48.68, "text": "救命啊"}, {"start": 48.68, "end": 52.08, "text": "你死吧"}, {"start": 53.08, "end": 54.85, "text": "你耍账"}, {"start": 54.85, "end": 57.03, "text": "吓死老子了"}, {"start": 57.03, "end": 58.03, "text": "祖宗保佑"}]}